cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Spec17Tre, please cite this repository."
title: "Spec17Tre: A Benchmark Dataset for Hardware-Level Spectre Attack Detection Using gem5 Simulation"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Aktas-Aydin"
    given-names: "Hatice"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HaticeAktasAydin/Spec17Tre"
abstract: >
  Spec17Tre is a benchmark dataset for hardware-level Spectre attack detection
  generated using the gem5 architectural simulator and the SPEC CPU2017 benchmark suite.
keywords:
  - Spectre
  - Hardware Security
  - Machine Learning
  - Deep Learning
  - gem5
  - SPEC CPU2017
